    "body": "Bumps the dependencies group with 2 updates: [github/gh-aw-actions/setup](https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions) and [github/gh-aw-actions/setup-cli](https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions).\n\nUpdates `github/gh-aw-actions/setup` from 0.91.4 to 0.92.6\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/releases\">github/gh-aw-actions/setup's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v0.92.4</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.92.4</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.92.3</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.92.3</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.92.2</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.92.2</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.92.1</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.92.1</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.92.0</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.92.0</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.14</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.14</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.13</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.13</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.12</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.12</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.11</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.11</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.10</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.10</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.9</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.9</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.8</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.8</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.7</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.7</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.6</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.6</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.91.5</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.91.5</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/8b9c5e98dfe3472ac4e3f13e0a2441cd078a2ca7\"><code>8b9c5e9</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.92.6 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/283\">#283</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/ebb97091a4afcc9bf2d594071dbabe861e9a34fc\"><code>ebb9709</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.92.5 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/282\">#282</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/cebbdc70aca80b87b82787ef6d8fed9748e21af2\"><code>cebbdc7</code></a> fix: create draft releases when syncing actions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/281\">#281</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/dc455073a216c68be9fe9a292c4371243c036d25\"><code>dc45507</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.92.4 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/280\">#280</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/26e5d7e7d2345ae4c8dfa3d9017ca2ff9bbf2c82\"><code>26e5d7e</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.92.3 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/279\">#279</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/0f69b0ad49724e06064e691f9fbd93dc2a652298\"><code>0f69b0a</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.92.2 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/278\">#278</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"